			"offsets": {
				"from": 585620,
				"to": 587140
			},
			"text": "就是东代那个人"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:09:47,140",
				"to": "00:09:47,940"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 587140,
				"to": 587940
			},
			"text": "Bels"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:09:47,940",
				"to": "00:09:49,500"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 587940,
				"to": 589500
			},
			"text": "Bels的这个人"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:09:49,500",
				"to": "00:09:57,060"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 589500,
				"to": 597060
			},
			"text": "他以前不安江森 其實也是四支很瘦 去幹很大"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:09:57,060",
				"to": "00:09:59,800"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 597060,
				"to": 599800
			},
			"text": "因為我們這個戶戴網傳染者都是這樣的"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:09:59,800",
				"to": "00:10:03,760"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 599800,
				"to": 603760
			},
			"text": "然後他就是奉行了伯基旅頓 去練了一下伯基"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:10:03,760",
				"to": "00:10:06,180"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 603760,
				"to": 606180
			},
			"text": "那伯安江森你可以看 現在不敢說伯基吧"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:10:06,180",
				"to": "00:10:07,860"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 606180,
				"to": 607860
			},
			"text": "但至少人家身體是健康的"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:10:07,860",
				"to": "00:10:12,100"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 607860,
				"to": 612100
			},
			"text": "對吧 有肌肉 有人家對這個基本是都做了"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:10:12,100",
				"to": "00:10:18,420"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 612100,
				"to": 618420
			},
			"text": "然後一種馬斯克 反而在不安江森的這個推特下的留言"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:10:18,420",
				"to": "00:10:22,440"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 618420,
				"to": 622440
			},
			"text": "就是也是一个打击脖击理论,他说什么呢?"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:10:22,440",
				"to": "00:10:26,780"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 622440,
				"to": 626780
			},
			"text": "You look better before,因为那个吧,不然这样子"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:10:26,780",
				"to": "00:10:32,900"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 626780,
				"to": 632900
			},
			"text": "把两个照片他以前的一个胖子,就是不健康的和他练了的"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:10:32,900",
				"to": "00:10:38,660"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 632900,
				"to": 638660
			},
			"text": "发来一块,你知道吗?就是靠到大家去见神嘛"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:10:38,660",
				"to": "00:10:44,540"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 638660,
				"to": 644540
			},
			"text": "去练,然后一楼网址反而在下面回一个,就说,哎我现在就是要扭曲你个阵子"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:10:44,540",
				"to": "00:10:46,500"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 644540,
				"to": 646500
			},
			"text": "我说你之前更好"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:10:46,500",
				"to": "00:10:49,500"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 646500,
				"to": 649500
			},
			"text": "你意思就是你这么久就是白脸对吧"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:10:49,500",
				"to": "00:10:50,780"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 649500,
				"to": 650780
			},
			"text": "屁股学点脑袋"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:10:50,780",
				"to": "00:10:52,660"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 650780,
				"to": 652660
			},
			"text": "马斯克屁股学点脑袋"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:10:52,660",
				"to": "00:10:54,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 652660,
				"to": 654700
			},
			"text": "在屁股学点脑袋"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:10:54,700",
				"to": "00:10:55,580"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 654700,
				"to": 655580
			},
			"text": "真是点"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:10:55,580",
				"to": "00:10:57,540"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 655580,
				"to": 657540
			},
			"text": "但是我今天这个屁股研脑袋"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:10:57,540",
				"to": "00:10:59,100"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 657540,
				"to": 659100
			},
			"text": "英龙马斯传播这个错误思想"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:10:59,100",
				"to": "00:11:00,460"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 659100,
				"to": 660460
			},
			"text": "吃亏最大的是谁"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:11:00,460",
				"to": "00:11:01,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 660460,
				"to": 661700
			},
			"text": "自己他自己"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:11:01,700",
				"to": "00:11:04,260"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 661700,
				"to": 664260
			},
			"text": "是英龙马斯自己"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:11:04,260",
				"to": "00:11:04,780"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 664260,
				"to": 664780
			},
			"text": "那个哎呀"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:11:04,780",
				"to": "00:11:05,660"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 664780,
				"to": 665660
			},
			"text": "也听给我讲了"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:11:05,660",
				"to": "00:11:06,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 665660,
				"to": 666700
			},
			"text": "英龙马斯克"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:11:06,700",
				"to": "00:11:08,300"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 666700,
				"to": 668300
			},
			"text": "就是现在已经比我大二十对"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:11:08,300",
				"to": "00:11:10,580"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 668300,
				"to": 670580
			},
			"text": "现在都五十六五七了"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:11:10,580",
				"to": "00:11:13,580"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 670580,
				"to": 673580
			},
			"text": "英龙马斯克没过一年"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:11:13,580",
				"to": "00:11:14,860"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 673580,
				"to": 674860
			},
			"text": "再不練脖肌"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:11:14,860",
				"to": "00:11:18,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 674860,
				"to": 678700
			},
			"text": "就又上十一年的保挥时光"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:11:18,700",
				"to": "00:11:20,660"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 678700,
				"to": 680660
			},
			"text": "因为每年的肌肉"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:11:20,660",
				"to": "00:11:24,580"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 680660,
				"to": 684580
			},
			"text": "按到百分之一百分之二的速度再下凉"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:11:24,580",
				"to": "00:11:27,220"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 684580,
				"to": 687220
			},
			"text": "而且如果你再过六十了"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:11:27,220",
				"to": "00:11:28,980"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 687220,
				"to": 688980
			},
			"text": "你练都来不及了"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:11:28,980",
				"to": "00:11:31,220"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 688980,
				"to": 691220
			},
			"text": "因为我们现在这个练可以"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:11:31,220",
				"to": "00:11:33,380"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 691220,
				"to": 693380
			},
			"text": "比如说两天这个循环"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:11:33,380",
				"to": "00:11:36,460"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 693380,
				"to": 696460
			},
			"text": "你后面要是这个身体的修复力差了"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:11:36,460",
				"to": "00:11:39,220"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 696460,
				"to": 699220
			},
			"text": "你可能要三四天四五天才一个循环"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:11:39,220",
				"to": "00:11:41,620"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 699220,
				"to": 701620
			},
			"text": "对 那个倾斜练的你要回复的"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:11:41,620",
				"to": "00:11:44,220"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 701620,
				"to": 704220
			},
			"text": "你又不是 对吧 狂唱期线"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:11:45,120",
				"to": "00:11:46,720"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 705120,
				"to": 706720
			},
			"text": "你要练 要恢复要这个"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:11:46,720",
				"to": "00:11:50,020"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 706720,
				"to": 710020
			},
			"text": "哇 这个就是后面这个账单会越级远"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:11:50,320",
				"to": "00:11:52,620"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 710320,
				"to": 712620
			},
			"text": "对 所以一定要练 而且趁早练"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:11:52,620",
				"to": "00:11:54,720"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 712620,
				"to": 714720
			},
			"text": "对 趁早练 趁早练"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:11:54,720",
				"to": "00:11:55,520"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 714720,
				"to": 715520
			},
			"text": "练练练 练练练"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:11:55,520",
				"to": "00:11:57,520"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 715520,
				"to": 717520
			},
			"text": "欢迎大家加入我们博弃区了"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:11:57,520",
				"to": "00:11:59,720"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 717520,
				"to": 719720
			},
			"text": "那这个博弃话题可能差不多到这边"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:11:59,720",
				"to": "00:12:01,120"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 719720,
				"to": 721120
			},
			"text": "我 我还想再稍微推进一下"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:12:01,120",
				"to": "00:12:02,120"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 721120,
				"to": 722120
			},
			"text": "我可以推进下一个还好"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:12:02,120",
				"to": "00:12:03,520"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 722120,
				"to": 723520
			},
			"text": "对 就是"
		}
	]
}
